#DESCRIPTION
Anisotropic electron pressure (CGL): parallel compression without conduction
or isotropization. Uniform guide field Bx with an IonAcousticWave density
perturbation along x drives parallel CGL compression: PePar ~ n^3 and
PePerp ~ n, so PePar/PePerp tracks (rho/rho0)^2 while Pe = (PePar + 2*PePerp)/3.

